victory3 = "Gettin' tired already? And just as I was getting started..."
victory4 = "Heh, don't even need any of those stupid magic moves to bust you up!"
victory5 = "Don'tcha call my technique boring! It's a tried and true classic 'round these parts!"
victory6 = "The Champ always gets up swingin' after getting knocked down!"

;Street Fighters
victory7 = "Callin' yourself a 'Street Fighter'? Now that gets a chuckle outta me, pal!"

;Kung Fu Man
victory8 = "A karate man that ain't using those cheap magic tricks? Now we're talkin'!"

;Boxers
victory9 = "These fists reign as the King in these streets, y'hear?!"

;Kick Masters
victory10 = "Masterin' your legs instead of your fists? Quite an odd style, but I like it."

;Mario
victory11 = "So you're that plumber I've been hearin' about around town. You're a darn sight to behold."

;Mega Man
victory12 = "This 'Super Fighting Robot' is a super load of garbage!"

